('How many colors are on a classic rainbow','Seven.'),('Which game usually uses a jump rope','Skipping.'),('How many sides does a standard die','Six.'),('Which one is a board game','Checkers.'),('How many wheels are on a standard bicycle','Two.'),('Which instrument has keys','A piano.'),('What do you mail with a stamp','A postcard.'),('Which season follows spring','Summer.'),('Which side of a book has its spine','The bound edge.'),('How many squares are on a standard chessboard','64.'),('Which usually has a zipper','A backpack.'),('Which game asks you to draw','Pictionary.'),
